T* (Harvest Management System. The integration strictly adheres to modern OAuth 2.1 and OpenID Connect \(OIDC\) security) Tj
T* (standards by utilizing the Authorization Code Flow augmented with Proof Key for Code Exchange \(PKCE, S256\) performed) Tj
T* (exclusively on the backend as a confidential client.) Tj
