T* (authorization codes, ID tokens, access tokens, or refresh tokens are ever exposed to browser JavaScript or stored on the) Tj
T* (client. Upon successful verification, the backend seamlessly issues the application's existing HttpOnly) Tj
T* ('harvest_access_token' session cookie, providing a frictionless user experience while upholding zero-trust security) Tj
T* (principles.) Tj
