(1. Rate Limiting: Authentication endpoints \(/api/auth/google, /api/auth/google/callback\) should be protected with) Tj
T* ('express-rate-limit' to prevent denial-of-service and state-generation floods.) Tj
T* (2. OAuth Consent Screen Verification: In Google Cloud Console, testing-mode consent screens expire credentials after 7) Tj
T* (days and limit access to 100 test users. Production deployment requires submitting the app for verification.) Tj
T* (3. Stateless Token Revocation: The session cookie 'harvest_access_token' is valid for 24 hours. For high-security) Tj
T* (environments, a Redis token blacklist or 'tokenVersion' user schema check should be added.) Tj
T* (4. Profile Completion: Google basic profiles do not include phone numbers. A profile completion modal should prompt) Tj
T* (Google-registered users for phone numbers before placing crop orders or listing harvest stock.) Tj
